B.FO=new A.i5("Patient App","Mid-Level Flutter Developer","03/2025 \u2014 current","Owned the SND patient app front-end end-to-end: built and shipped the entire Flutter client for SND's healthcare and pharmacy subscription platform as the sole front-end developer on the product. Structured the codebase into Clean Architecture layers (data, domain, features) with BLoC/Cubit state management, GetIt for dependency injection, and GoRouter for navigation. To keep a 20+ module feature set \u2014 subscriptions, prescriptions, scheduling, provider discovery, payments \u2014 maintainable and easy to extend without a dedicated front-end team.\n\nDelivered core patient flows: implemented subscription management, prescription and medical-record handling, service scheduling and reservations, a cashback/points system, and location-based discovery of clinics, labs, hospitals and pharmacies. Built the data layer on Dio with Hive for local caching and offline resilience, and used Syncfusion's PDF viewer and flutter_map/geolocator for documents and maps.\n\nBuilt payment, security and release infrastructure: integrated Paymob and credit-card payments, biometric login with flutter_secure_storage, Firebase Crashlytics and Cloud Messaging, and full Arabic/English localization. Adopted Shorebird for over-the-air code-push updates.","assets/images/company_logos/snd_patient_app_logo.jpeg")
B.FR=new A.i5("SND Doctors (Provider App)","Mid-Level Flutter Developer","08/2025 \u2014 current","Built the SND Doctors provider app as its sole Flutter developer: delivered the companion app used by clinics, hospitals, labs and pharmacies to manage their presence on SND, sharing the same Clean Architecture, BLoC/Cubit, GetIt and GoRouter foundation as the patient app for consistency and faster delivery.\n\nImplemented provider-side operations: built institution and staff management, patient requests and reservations, scheduling, and invoicing as independent BLoC-driven feature modules reusing a shared widget and animation library.\n\nAdded analytics and onboarding tooling: built performance dashboards with fl_chart, guided walkthroughs with showcaseview, and secure biometric access with push notifications.","assets/images/company_logos/snd_provider_app_logo.jpg")
B.Jf=s([B.FO,B.FR],t.KV)
B.hw=s([],t.S6)
