B.FQ=new A.i5("Slash App","Flutter Developer (Intern \u2192 Flutter Developer)","07/2024 \u2014 12/2024","Built a web version of the main app: adapted the existing Flutter mobile app for the browser using Flutter Web, keeping behavior and design consistent across platforms.\n\nLed a UI modernization and theming overhaul: rebuilt the app's UI on a new design system with full light/dark theme support, working closely with the design team on responsive layouts and reusable components.\n\nRaised code quality through testing and review: wrote unit tests to catch regressions early and took an active role in code reviews, pushing for consistent patterns across the codebase.","assets/images/company_logos/slash_app_logo.png")
B.FM=new A.i5("Slash Seller App","Flutter Developer (Intern)","07/2024 \u2014 10/2024","Refactored the Slash seller app into Clean Architecture: restructured the codebase into independent layers (data, domain, presentation) alongside the team, improving modularity and making the app easier to extend and test.","assets/images/company_logos/slash_seller_app_logo.png")
